  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Cherissa Tamayori described leveraging technology such as artificial intelligence and areas in which the commercial sector is investing. She said that, as a buyer of AI technology, the government needs to proactively address ethical concerns and that she believes the RAI report will help the program management and acquisition communities do so.",
